{
  "id": "165",
  "title": "The Smartest Son",
  "level": "elementary",
  "date": "2016-08-03",
  "synopsis": "Little Ming asks his father what it's like to have the smartest son in the world, and his father has a clever reply for him.",
  "audioUrl": "https://static.duchinese.net/documents/181/58278cb810ec0066e612afa15d2676901d13b216.mp3",
  "series": null,
  "fullText": {
    "simplified": "聪明的儿子\n\n一天，小明问他的爸爸：“爸爸，拥有世界上最聪明的儿子是什么感觉？”\n爸爸说：“不知道。这个你得问问你的爷爷。”",
    "traditional": "聰明的兒子\n\n一天，小明問他的爸爸：“爸爸，擁有世界上最聰明的兒子是什麼感覺？”\n爸爸說：“不知道。這個你得問問你的爺爺。”"
  },
